  "writing_rules": [
    "Relationship rows store only current mechanical scores; explanation history and empty evidence arrays are not state.",
    "Personal obligations are sparse unresolved current duties only; resolving or forgiving one removes its row instead of appending history.",
    "Beliefs exist only for exact people whose current belief is causally relevant; newer evidence replaces or revises the current row and closed subjects are pruned.",
    "Belief rows are perception only; authoritative truth stays in the owning family, property, contract, custody, faction, movement, or other domain record and is never duplicated into a generic social fact ledger.",
    "Vows persist only unusual explicit personal commitments that can affect current decisions; faction culture remains canonical institutional data.",
    "Martial familiarity stores bounded current opponent adaptation summaries from meaningful small exact-combat exchanges; incidental impressions are pruned and mass battle does not materialize a pairwise participant matrix.",
    "Empty relationships/courtships/obligations/beliefs/vows/martial_familiarity maps are omitted.",
    "Courtship start time persists because it is current relationship-stage chronology consumed by family state."
  ]
